%\n 52 | 응답자명         |       6% |      18% |      16% |      20% |      22%\n 53 | 응답자부서        |       7% |      21% |       7% |      19% |      20%\n 54 | 응답자직위        |       4% |      17% |       2% |      19% |      20%\n 55 | 응답자연락처       |      10% |      25% |      19% |      20% |      26%\n 56 | 응답자이메일       |       4% |      14% |       4% |       9% |       9%\n\n=== BIKO COMPARISON ===\n\n[배현명] 비고 top 5: [[\"(빈값)\",1702],[\"폐업\",228],[\"휴업\",9],[\"폐업,옮은사업자번호:136-87-01124\",1],[\"옮은사업자번호:761-87-01634\",1]]\n\n[안재한] 비고 top 5: [[\"(빈값)\",1148],[\"폐업\",139],[\"전화번호가 다름\",96],[\"주소가 다름\",66],[\"주소,전화번호가 다름\",28]]\n\n[정은미] 비고 top 5: [[\"(빈값)\",847],[\"폐업자\",40],[\"\",5],[\"장춘임대\",1],[\"긱스\",1]]\n\n[차민영] 비고 top 5: [[\"(빈값)\",813],[\"\",16],[\"네이버: 전화번호 변경\",9],[\"비즈노넷: 대표자 변경\",9],[\"네이버: 대표번호 변경\",5]]\n\n[이수민] 비고 top 5: [[\"(빈값)\",937],[\"회사명변경\",14],[\"전화번호번경\",5],[\"주소변경\",5],[\"대표자변경\",4]]\n\n"}
{"step_index":63,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T02:49:16Z","input_tokens":3811,"cache_read_tokens":57095,"output_tokens":3766,"thinking":" 배현명 processed the most data rows, significantly more than colleagues. Notably, 배현명's data completion for specific fields, particularly \"우편번호\" and \"형태,\" stands out, suggesting a potential specialization or unique data handling approach. This disparity requires investigation to understand its implications for overall data quality or processing efficiency.\n\n\nAnalyzing field completion rates reveals 배현명's exceptional performance in populating fields such as \"법인번호\", \"결산월\", \"우편번호\", and \"업종\", strongly suggesting a reliance on a specific data source. The data's characteristics point to NICE BizINFO as a primary source for 배현명's data. This hypothesis explains the high completion rate for these specific fields, alongside the low rate for respondent information, which would require direct contact.\n\n\nFocusing on 배현명's data, a detailed audit of quality issues begins, specifically targeting rows with the pattern of respondent information inclusion, starting with a script to address row 5435 and examine \"비고\" column for errors like typos, incorrect entries, and inconsistent use of \"(폐업)\".\n\nInvestigating potential date format inconsistencies, including incomplete entries like \"2008-\", along with identification of non-standard date formats (YYYYMMDD, YYYY. M. D., etc.) is required. Further analysis targets invalid contact information such as single-character phone numbers/emails and the presence of URLs in the email fields, and checks for missing leading zeros in phone numbers.\n\nFinally, the 11 instances of respondent information in closed or inactive companies needs clarification, seeking to determine the context of these entries (e.g., previous contact or status of communication).\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst readline = require('readline');\n\nconst filePath = \"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\Desktop\\\\Today\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_여기까지했어요.csv\";\n\nfunction parseCSVLine(text) {\n    const res = [];\n    let cur = '';\n    let inQuotes = false;\n    for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {\n        const c = text[i];\n        if (inQuotes) {\n            if (c === '\"') {\n                if (i + 1 < text.length && text[i + 1] === '\"') {\n                    cur += '\"';\n                    i++;\n                } else {\n                    inQuotes = false;\n                }\n            } else {\n                cur += c;\n            }\n        } else {\n            if (c === '\"') {\n                inQuotes = true;\n            } else if (c === ',') {\n                res.push(cur);\n                cur = '';\n            } else {\n                cur += c;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    res.push(cur);\n    return { fields: res, inQuotes };\n}\n\nasync function detailedAudit() {\n    const fileStream = fs.createReadStream(filePath, { encoding: 'utf-8' });\n    const rl = readline.createInterface({\n        input: fileStream,\n        crlfDelay: Infinity\n    });\n\n    let header = null;\n    let lineNum = 0;\n    let multiline = '';\n    let inQuotes = false;\n\n    const bhmRows = [];\n\n    for await (const line of rl) {\n        lineNum++;\n        let currentLine = line;\n        if (lineNum === 1 && currentLine.charCodeAt(0) === 0xFEFF) {\n            currentLine = currentLine.slice(1);\n        }\n\n        if (inQuotes) {\n            multiline += '\\n' + currentLine;\n        } else {\n            multiline = currentLine;\n        }\n\n        const parsed = parseCSVLine(multiline);\n        if (parsed.inQuotes) {\n            inQuotes = true;\n            continue;\n        } else {\n            inQuotes = false;\n        }\n\n        const fields = parsed.fields;\n        if (!header) {\n            header = fields;\n            continue;\n        }\n\n        const author = fields[0] ? fields[0].trim() : '';\n        if (author.includes('배현명')) {\n            bhmRows.push({ lineNum, fields });\n        }\n    }\n\n    console.log(`Analyzing ${bhmRows.length} BHM rows...`);\n\n    // 1. Check Date Formats breakdown\n    const dateCounts = {};\n    const dateHyphenTrailing = [];\n    const dateNonStandard = [];\n    bhmRows.forEach(r => {\n        const d = r.fields[12] ? r.fields[12].trim() : '';\n        if (!d) return;\n        if (/^\\d{4}-$/.test(d)) {\n            dateCounts['YYYY- (끝에 하이픈만 있음)'] = (dateCounts['YYYY- (끝에 하이픈만 있음)'] || 0) + 1;\n            if (dateHyphenTrailing.length < 5) dateHyphenTrailing.push({ lineNum: r.lineNum, company: r.fields[2], val: d });\n        } else if (/^\\d{4}-\\d{1,2}$/.test(d)) {\n            dateCounts['YYYY-M 또는 YYYY-MM'] = (dateCounts['YYYY-M 또는 YYYY-MM'] || 0) + 1;\n        } else if (/^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$/.test(d)) {\n            dateCounts['YYYY-MM-DD'] = (dateCounts['YYYY-MM-DD'] || 0) + 1;\n        } else if (/^\\d{4}$/.test(d)) {\n            dateCounts['YYYY (연도만)'] = (dateCounts['YYYY (연도만)'] || 0) + 1;\n        } else {\n            dateCounts['비표준 (YYYYMMDD, . 등)'] = (dateCounts['비표준 (YYYYMMDD, . 등)'] || 0) + 1;\n            dateNonStandard.push({ lineNum: r.lineNum, company: r.fields[2], val: d });\n        }\n    });\n\n    console.log('\\n=== 설립일자(Col 12) 포맷 통계 ===');\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(dateCounts, null, 2));\n    console.log('Trailing hyphen samples:', dateHyphenTrailing);\n    console.log('Non-standard dates count:', dateNonStandard.length, 'Samples:', dateNonStandard.slice(0, 10));\n\n    // 2. Company name containing (폐업)\n    console.log('\\n=== 회사명에 (폐업) 등이 포함된 경우 ===');\n    const compNameAnomalies = [];\n    bhmRows.forEach(r => {\n        const c = r.fields[2] ? r.fields[2].trim() : '';\n        if (c.includes('폐업') || c.includes('휴업') || c.includes('이전') || c.includes('삭제')) {\n            compNameAnomalies.push({ lineNum: r.lineNum, company: c, biko: r.fields[1] });\n        }\n    });\n    console.log('Found:', compNameAnomalies);\n\n    // 3. Biz Number differences (Col 3 vs Col 23)\n    console.log('\\n=== 사업자번호(Col 3) vs 원본 사업자번호(Col 23) 불일치 ===');\n    const bizDiffs = [];\n    bhmRows.forEach(r => {\n        const b3 = r.fields[3] ? r.fields[3].trim() : '';\n        const b23 = r.fields[23] ? r.fields[23].trim() : '';\n        if (b3 !== b23) {\n            bizDiffs.push({\n                lineNum: r.lineNum,\n                company: r.fields[2],\n                bizCol3: b3,\n                bizCol23: b23,\n                biko: r.fields[1]\n            });\n        }\n    });\n    console.log(`Total biz diff count: ${bizDiffs.length}`);\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(bizDiffs, null, 2));\n\n    // 4. Phone numbers missing leading 0\n    console.log('\\n=== 전화번호 맨 앞자리 0 누락 (엑셀 숫자서식 오류 의심) ===');\n    const missingZeroPhones = [];\n    bhmRows.forEach(r => {\n        [7, 8, 55].forEach(colIdx => {\n            const p = r.fields[colIdx] ? r.fields[colIdx].trim() : '';\n            // if it starts with 10, 51, 2, 70, 31, etc. and is purely numeric with 8~10 digits\n            if (/^(10\\d{7,8}|[2-6]\\d{7,9}|70\\d{7,8})$/.test(p)) {\n                missingZeroPhones.push({\n                    lineNum: r.lineNum,\n                    company: r.fields[2],\n                    colName: header[colIdx],\n                    val: p,\n                    suggested: '0' + p\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    });\n    console.log(`Found ${missingZeroPhones.length} missing leading zero phones:`);\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(missingZeroPhones, null, 2));\n\n    // 5. Notes with typos\n    console.log('\\n=== 비고 오타 / 비표준 상세 ===');\n    const noteTypos = [];\n    bhmRows.forEach(r => {\n        const b = r.fields[1] ? r.fields[1].trim() : '';\n        if (b.includes('옮은') || b.includes('패업') || b.includes('맞는')) {\n            noteTypos.push({ lineNum: r.lineNum, company: r.fields[2], biko: b });\n        }\n    });\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(noteTypos, null, 2));\n\n    // 6. Dot or hyphen placeholder in emails / phones\n    console.log('\\n=== 연락처/이메일에 단순 점(.) 또는 하이픈(-) 표기 ===');\n    const placeholderItems = [];\n    bhmRows.forEach(r => {\n        [7, 8, 10, 55, 56].forEach(colIdx => {\n            const v = r.fields[colIdx] ? r.fields[colIdx].trim() : '';\n            if (v === '.' || v === '-' || v === '..' || v === '/') {\n                placeholderItems.push({\n                    lineNum: r.lineNum,\n                    company: r.fields[2],\n                    colName: header[colIdx],\n                    val: v\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    });\n    console.log(`Found ${placeholderItems.length} placeholders:`);\n    console.log(JSON.stringify(placeholderItems, null, 2));\n\n    // 7. Check Line 5435 corruption detail\n    console.log('\\n=== Line 5435 (부경기계산업) 상세 분석 ===');\n    const r5435 = bhmRows.find(r => r.lineNum === 5435);\n    if (r5435) {\n        console.log('Raw fields around 5435:');\n        header.forEach((h, idx) => {\n            console.log(`  [${idx}] ${h}: \"${r5435.fields[idx]}\"`);\n        });\n    }\n}\n\ndetailedAudit().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Detailed audit of date formats, phone numbers, placeholders, typos, and corrupted rows","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\f5c8b43a-5c52-40dc-83ac-10d0b6555d1e\\scratch\\detailed_audit.js","toolAction":"Writing detailed audit script","toolSummary":"Write detailed audit script"}}]}
